cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, cite it as below (CC BY 4.0 — attribution naming Baipiaoji with a link to baipiaoji.com satisfies the license)."
title: "Verified AI Free-Tier Limits"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Baipiaoji (baipiaoji.com)"
    website: "https://baipiaoji.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/f-tiger/verified-ai-free-tiers"
url: "https://baipiaoji.com/limits.json"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Free-tier limits of AI tools, hand-verified against official vendor pages —
  every figure carries an official source link and a check date; contradictory or
  unpublished figures are recorded as such rather than guessed. This repository
  mirrors the live dataset rebuilt daily from baipiaoji.com. The dataset is
  living: cite the URL together with the check date of the figures you used
  (no DOI is registered).
